<title>NEW ZEALAND: Queen Charlotte 15 mth loss NZ$3.0 mln.</title>
<headline>Queen Charlotte 15 mth loss NZ$3.0 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>15 months to June 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				 3.00 vs 0.33 (12 mth loss)</p>
<p>    Div					    nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				  nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Turnover				   31.79 vs 24.81</p>
<p>    Abnormals				   3.75 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Pretax loss				 3.00 vs 0.33</p>
<p>    Tax					   0.01 vs none</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	 28.63 vs same</p>
<p>Note - Queen Charlotte Holdings Ltd was formerly Regal Salmon Ltd, a fish farmer. Queen Charlotte said the sale of its business assets to the Tsiong Group subsidiary Southern Ocean Seafoods Ltd had been completed, with the company holding NZ$1.1</p>
